            <ArticleTitle>Canalicular cholestasis induced by anabolic steroids.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>735-736</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.17235/reed.2017.4781/2016</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Inappropriate use of anabolic steroids is increasing, usually by younger males in an illicit manner. This is a well-documented case of cholestatic hepatitis attributed to use of anabolic steroids for esthetic and/or athletic purposes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
